# The extension's provisioned settings carry this machine's API key.
#
# The desktop application writes it into the extension folder so the browser can
# be handed a copy that needs no configuration. It is per-install and must never
# be committed - a key in the repository is a key shared by everyone who clones
# it. The file is untracked rather than merely ignored, because ignoring a file
# git already follows changes nothing.
phishlens-extension/provisioned.js
